# {{Module}} (game module, adopted)

The game's own StudWork module, added by `tools/adopt --init` (StudWork {{tag}}). Its save section
key is `{{gameId}}`. The migration plan is `studwork-adopt-report.md` at the project root (from
`tools/adopt --audit`); the design is `studwork/docs/framework/adopting.md`.

## Save map

Every field of the old save, and where it lives in StudWork (a kit section through the kit's
`txApi`, or this module's own section). A field a product sold maps to a currency listed in
`compliance.paidCurrencies` (or to items, tagged paid by the import). A field that is dropped says
why. `tools/test-migration` checks the fixtures in `tests/legacy/` against this map.

